  "title": "Sriracha Honey Chicken Legs",
  "description": "Baked chicken is tossed in a sweet and spicy mix of honey, butter, and sriracha sauce in this low-carb weeknight chicken legs recipe full of flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Nicole"
